            &copy; 2025 - Dreariest 'Taxy' Tax 53 - <a asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Privacy">Privacy</a>
        </div>
        <div class="container">
            <p>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sabarieswar-vimal-74496523a/">LinkedIn</a>
              |  
            <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/dtax53.bsky.social">Bluesky</a>
              |  
            <a href="https://github.com/DTax53">Github</a>
            </p>
